{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZIP! 春フェス2014どうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のアーティストさんも出るので乃木坂ファミリーさんが見えるまで心配だったんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージ立った瞬間自分の名前が入ったうちわを見つけたり声援くださったりで心配吹き飛びました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして他のアーティストのファンの皆様にも乃木坂を知っていただけて嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有り難う御座います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来れなかったけど応援してくださったかたへ、\n今回のセットリストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロマンスのスタート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！Bicycle"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルール"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら片想い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名は希望"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でしたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的にハウスメガシャキのCMソングのロマンスのスタートが凄い好きで、初披露できて良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVも公開されましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た？まあや途中で音響さんの役やったよ〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてZIP! de ポン♪をおいでシャンプーの曲中にしましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポンポンポポポ〜ン♪ジップでっ！ポンッ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってやりましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春フェス"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のいいスタートがきれましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"翌日の朝のZIP!にも沢山うつってたみたいで嬉しいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だっふんだぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日はPON!祭がありましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZIP!フェス同様、沢山の方が見に来てくださってて嬉しかったです......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PON！は今までで一番お客さんが多かったそうで嬉しいかぎりです (*≧∀≦*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーの曲中でハイタッチする振りがあるんですけど、\n白石麻衣ちゃん！松村さゆりちゃんとハイタッチする時、\n実はハイタッチしながら人差し指だけ立ててポーズとってたのわかった人いるかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハの時もずっとやってて、本番でもやっちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ気付いた人がもしいたら本当に凄い！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントでも応援してくれて\nありがとうございました(*´∇｀*)\nいつも心強いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/28/0891788/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜ん...きいちゃんは何を困ってるんだろね〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問のコメントに答えてくれてありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆、いろんなペット飼ってて、いろんな名前をつけてて、\n中には沢山の名前をつけてる方もいたし、まあや！って名前もあった〜笑笑\nビックリしました    笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は初コメさんや同級生だよ！ってコメントが増えてて嬉しいですo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１つだけ質問返しなんだけど、\nまあやは学生なのでパーマもカラーもしてないよ〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事の時は巻いてもらえるの♪(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家の愛犬 ポテトも元気です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癖は、眠くなると右手(前足？)をお口にいれておしゃぶりするの〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時すっごく小さいベロが垂れてて可愛い〜の(*≧∀≦*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘えん坊で、すぐに膝の上にくるし♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんは、小さい時の まあやがしてたことと同じよって言ってた〜  笑笑\n(でも舌は出してないよ〜笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、まあやと同じ１人暮らしの方は誰にも言う人がいないって教えてくれてたから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「お〜か〜え〜り〜＼(^o^)／」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞こえた？？(//∇//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日はみおなちゃん家に、\nきぃちゃんとろってぃ、まあやで遊びに来てます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またそれについては次回書きます！(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フジテレビ土曜にもうすぐ\n夕方六時からミュージックフェアあるから見てね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、\nBLTの連載のやつでカメラマンをまなったんともしたよ♪見てみてね(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"29日は乃木坂の聖母\nまいまいの誕生日です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に優しいし、よく気がつくし、癒し系だし...沢山ありすぎるくらい\n素敵な尊敬する\nお姉ちゃんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き〜o(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年になりますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピクニックに行くなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おにぎり？サンドイッチ？\nタコさんウインナー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}